{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cat Snap \u2013 a cozy puzzle game about capturing adorable moments!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide a free-spirited kitty around each level and snap the perfect moment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play with the kitty in all kinds of scenes</strong><br>Interact with the cat as it wanders, plays, and reacts to different situations, then catch the moment with your camera!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique cat behavior in every level</strong><br>Each stage features different movements and playful antics. Try new ways to guide the kitty and discover cute poses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take photos</strong><br>Capture one or more photos per level and collect your favorite memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Photo Album</strong><br>Browse every picture you've taken and look back on your adorable moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Specs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime: <strong>About 30 minutes</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3313200?t=1768126402","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313200/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768126402","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313200/600a0262bd04366edcc8e0fceab709a45a59c1d1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768126402","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313200/600a0262bd04366edcc8e0fceab709a45a59c1d1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768126402","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3952560,"descrip